G1 linear lapse EL (E1 op, vac/window): 0
on-shell background eps^2 (r->1/t): GM2*alpha*t**4 + 6*GM2*t**4
S (1/r^4 harmonic) = GM2*(alpha + 6)
A*GM2 = (-alpha - 6)/(8*cN)   A = phi2/U_N^2 = (-alpha - 6)/(8*GM2*cN)
BETA = 1 + phi2/U_N^2 = (8*GM2*cN - alpha - 6)/(8*GM2*cN)
G3: alpha=0 -> A0 = -3/(4*GM2*cN)  (0 = Einstein-isotropic consistency)
G4: S(alpha) = S0 + alpha*S_a:  S(alpha=0) = 6*GM2   S(alpha=1) = 7*GM2
